BEHAVIOR 1 — #77 de-export is compile-enforced (tsc)
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Guard: the three de-exported helpers (solvedStageIds, buildChainSites,
buildChain) are module-private; any external import must fail to compile.

PASS   : npx tsc -b → exit 0 (no external importer exists).
BREAK  : add src/ui/_biditest_deexport.ts:
           import { buildChain } from "./chain-view.ts";
FAIL   : tsc raised
           _biditest_deexport.ts(2,10): error TS2459: Module
           '"./chain-view.ts"' declares 'buildChain' locally, but it is not
